      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "text": "Vector store at scale (pgvector / Azure AI Search / Pinecone) — not a local JSON file\nDedicated, autoscaled embedding service, called in batches, not inline per query\nContinuous ingestion pipeline (event-driven crawlers + chunkers) keeps docs, runbooks and wikis re-indexed as they change\nRedis holds per-session conversation memory (multi-turn context); the vector store holds global, cross-session knowledge",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Vector store at scale (pgvector / Azure AI Search / Pinecone) — not a local JSON file\nDedicated, autoscaled embedding service, called in batches, not inline per query\nContinuous ingestion pipeline (event-driven crawlers + chunkers) keeps docs, runbooks and wikis re-indexed as they change\nRedis holds per-session conversation memory (multi-turn context); the vector store holds global, cross-session knowledge",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
